Laya Typed-Decisions model and ONNX conversion

The experimental Laya Typed-Decisions route fetches its model files separately
from onnx-community/laya-typed-decisions-ONNX at revision
79c441b22da79eb3727bb01e8452e29a32cfa548. The conversion identifies
convaiinnovations/laya-typed-decisions at revision
e929ae5cf69bc34259cd2f95c9e91145b818b1f0 as its source. The pinned model
cards declare Apache-2.0. Model assets are not bundled in this package.

The adapter preserves the documented Choice, Score, and Noul tensor protocol,
the checkpoint tokenizer IDs, question temperatures, option order, and
diagnostic action logits. The action head is not used for abstention. See the
upstream model card and
https://github.com/ykoh42/web-decision/blob/main/docs/model-support/LAYA_TYPED_SUPPORT.md
for measured behavior and limits.
